                                                          camera_server->handle_display_rotation_change((int)orientation);\n                                                                         }\n+\n+                                                                        DisplayServer *display_server = DisplayServer::get_singleton();\n+                                                                        if (display_server) {\n+                                                                                int out = 0;\n+                                                                                if (UIInterfaceOrientationIsPortrait(orientation)) {\n+                                                                                        out = 1;\n+                                                                                } else if (UIInterfaceOrientationIsLandscape(orientation)) {\n+                                                                                        out = 2;\n+                                                                                }\n+                                                                                display_server->emit_signal(\"orientation_changed\", out);\n+                                                                        }\n                                                                 }];\n }\n #endif\n```","created_at":"2026-01-27T10:44:04Z","updated_at":"2026-01-27T10:44:04Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115434#discussion_r2731389147","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115434","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2731389147"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115434#discussion_r2731389147"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115434"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2731389147/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":2541,"original_line":2541,"side":"RIGHT","author_association":"MEMBER","original_position":9,"position":9,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2731577209","pull_request_review_id":3710658465,"id":2731577209,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc6i0I95","diff_hunk":"@@ -2533,6 +2533,16 @@\n \t\t\t</description>\n \t\t</method>\n \t</methods>\n+\t<signals>\n+\t\t<signal name=\"orientation_changed\">\n+\t\t\t<param index=\"0\" name=\"orientation\" type=\"int\" />\n+\t\t\t<description>\n+\t\t\t\tEmitted when the device orientation changes. [param orientation] is the new orientation.\n+\t\t\t\tReturns [code]1[/code] for portrait, [code]2[/code] for landscape, and [code]0[/code] if the orientation is undefined.\n+\t\t\t\t[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on Android.","path":"doc/classes/DisplayServer.xml","commit_id":"16954e14d40c38e44e0f88e60352e73279b2e1e5","original_commit_id":"16954e14d40c38e44e0f88e60352e73279b2e1e5","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandS